        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robert Peston, Sophy Ridge\n- Programs: Peston on Sunday, Sophy Ridge on Sunday\n- Organizations: ITV News\n- Roles: Political Editor\n- Topics: late-2000s financial crisis, Northern Rock crisis\n\nFacts:\n- Robert Peston became known to a wider public through his reporting on the late-2000s financial crisis.\n- Robert Peston was especially noted for his scoop on the Northern Rock crisis.\n- Peston on Sunday is presented by Robert Peston.\n- Robert Peston is the Political Editor of ITV News.\n- Peston on Sunday features discussion with politicians and public figures on the major news events of the week.\n- Sophy Ridge on Sunday follows a similar format to Peston on Sunday.\n- Sophy Ridge on Sunday is broadcast at the same time as Peston on Sunday.",
